=== any with generator expression
xs.any? { |x| x > 0 }

=== all with generator expression
xs.all? { |x| x > 0 }

=== any with generator expression and condition
xs.any? { |x| x % 2 == 0 && x > 0 }

=== any with equality comparison
xs.any? { |x| x == target }

=== any assigns to variable
found = xs.any? { |x| x > 0 }
